          deckDescription: 'Two standard 32-tile Chinese domino sets (64 tiles total). Each tile has two ends showing pip patterns; no Western playing cards. Bagchen uses the double set so each player receives 16 tiles. Sky and Earth suits with ranking within each suit.',
          suitDescription: 'Chinese dominoes do not use Western suits; tiles are grouped by pip pattern and pair types (civil and military). Matching is by identical or complementary tile faces. Each tile is unique in the 32-tile set.',
          rankDescription: 'Tiles have no single rank order; they are matched by face pattern (pips or duplicates). Scoring and legality depend on the specific Bagchen rules and the tile combinations that form pairs or sets.',
